{"slug":"a-literal-baseplate.-FD-Collision-19178","_id":"66f80c02f5ba2f22f379a0ae","title":"FD Collision","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77dac","gameId":4483381587,"name":"[TITLE UNAVAILABLE]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d6ab265526e55195cc409f9a1a5a379dfe45dec124b4243419127dca36858958.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-87249609dae614261c1058785f217b72/480/270/UnapprovedImage/Png/noFilter"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d6ab265526e55195cc409f9a1a5a379dfe45dec124b4243419127dca36858958.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-87249609dae614261c1058785f217b72/480/270/UnapprovedImage/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":4483381587},"features":"Makes you able to get moved around by other players, but you can't move around them (kinda pointless)\n\nIf you want to support me, go through this linkvertise\nhttps://link-target.net/1262127/support-me","tags":["FD","Collision"],"script":"function partadded(part)\n    if part:IsA(\"BasePart\") and (string.find(part.Name:lower(),\"torso\") or string.find(part.Name:lower(),\"humanoidrootpart\") or string.find(part.Name:lower(),\"head\")) then\n        part.CanCollide = true\n        part.CollisionGroup = \"Default\"\n    end\nend\nfunction charadded(char)\n    for i,v in pairs(char:GetChildren()) do\n        partadded(v)\n    end\n    char.ChildAdded:Connect(function(part)\n        partadded(part)\n    end)\nend\nfunction plradded(plr)\n    if plr.Character then\n        charadded(plr.Character)\n    end\n    plr.CharacterAdded:Connect(function(char)\n        charadded(char)\n    end)\nend\nfor i,v in pairs(game.Players:GetPlayers()) do\n    plradded(v)\nend\ngame.Players.PlayerAdded:Connect(function(plr)\n    plradded(plr)\nend)","owner":{"_id":"66d682a10a9db34a5ce7a22f","username":"areyoumental110","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/36d3d1bc423ed03b6047db7efafd8434e187c51224cb401263e7d115a561413c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/pho